zone:0:0:0:0:0:0:Welcome warrior, I hope you like the surprises I prepared for you, I spilled many of my toys while flying from here, and they are lost, I think they can move without human power, be careful here, come back healthy before anything happens to you, you can also earn special rewards by killing mountain bears.:trackme